# CR 612: Artificial Evolution changes Giott's text, Dwarf to Thopter, so it now says "Giott or another Thopter you control enters". Bot1's Ornithopter (a Thopter) entering
# triggers it: Bot1 discards the Magda from its hand and draws the Magda on top of the library. A Dwarf, Magda, entering on turn 3 asks nothing: the stack is empty once
# she has resolved (Giott's trigger for Dwarves is gone; Giott itself still triggers whatever the word says, which turn 1's first trigger, declined, showed before the change).

